@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Manejo Centralizado de Excepciones con Spring Boot (@RestControllerAdvice)

actor "Cliente (Frontend)" as Client
participant "DispatcherServlet (Spring MVC)" as Dispatcher
participant "BaseRestController" as Controller
participant "BaseService" as ServiceLayer
participant "BaseRepository" as Repository
participant "ExceptionHandlerController (@RestControllerAdvice)" as AdviceHandler

== 1. Petición y Detección de Recurso Inexistente ==

Client -> Dispatcher: GET /api/v1/resource/999
activate Dispatcher

Dispatcher -> Controller: findById(999)
activate Controller

Controller -> ServiceLayer: findById(999)
activate ServiceLayer

ServiceLayer -> Repository: findById(999)
activate Repository
Repository --> ServiceLayer: Optional.empty()
deactivate Repository

ServiceLayer -> ServiceLayer: findOrResourceNotFoundException(Optional.empty(), "ID", 999)
ServiceLayer --[#red]> Controller: throw new ResourceNotFoundException("Resource not found with ID: 999")
deactivate ServiceLayer

Controller --[#red]> Dispatcher: Propagación de excepción no capturada
deactivate Controller

== 2. Intercepción Transversal y Formato Estandarizado ==

Dispatcher -> AdviceHandler: Resolver excepción mediante HandlerExceptionResolver
activate AdviceHandler
note over AdviceHandler
  @ExceptionHandler(ResourceNotFoundException.class)
  Construye DTO normalizado ErrorMessage con timestamp, código y mensaje.
end note

AdviceHandler --> Dispatcher: ResponseEntity<ErrorMessage> [HTTP 404 Not Found]
deactivate AdviceHandler

Dispatcher --> Client: 404 Not Found\n{\n  "statusCode": 404,\n  "timestamp": "2026-10-28T12:00:00Z",\n  "message": "Resource not found with ID: 999",\n  "description": "uri=/api/v1/resource/999"\n}
deactivate Dispatcher

@enduml